cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MultiDock1.0 in your research, please cite this software release and AutoDock Vina."
title: "MultiDock1.0"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Nguyen"
    given-names: "Duc Tri Thuc"
    affiliation: "Faculty of Pharmacy, Ton Duc Thang University"
abstract: >-
  MultiDock1.0 is a graphical research workflow for automated ligand
  preparation, batch molecular docking using AutoDock Vina, docking-score
  extraction, ranking, and result management for medicinal chemistry and
  computer-aided drug discovery research.
keywords:
  - molecular docking
  - virtual screening
  - AutoDock Vina
  - medicinal chemistry
  - computer-aided drug discovery
license: MIT
